    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n30 feet. A creature that enters the emanation must attempt a 19 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature is sickened 1, or sickened 2 on a critical failure. While within the aura, the creature takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is immune to all sigbins' stenches for 1 minute."
            },
            "id": "91caecd4-a4b3-477a-86d5-24775118ada4",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:16.106207"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Unassuming Cloak"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(illusion)\n\nA sigbin becomes almost imperceptible if it stands completely still. If the sigbin does not move or attack during its turn, it becomes invisible. It remains invisible until it moves or takes a hostile action. Children and young creatures, like animal cubs, can see the sigbin normally, even while it's invisible."
            },
            "id": "a83f9e47-8539-4aa8-901e-d7521c69a393",
            "updated_at": {
